       "en": "Pick this **Mawpit** to be a **sinkhole**. Then, you can pick another terrain feature within 12\" of this **Mawpit** and that you have not already picked to be a **sinkhole** this battle to be a **sinkhole** for the rest of the turn.\n\nThen, pick each enemy unit within 3\" of the **sinkhole(s)** to be the targets.\n\nFrom the second battle round onwards, increase the range at which another terrain feature can be picked to be a **sinkhole** by 3\" for each previous battle round. If this terrain feature has a **Head Butcher**, increase the range at which another terrain feature can be picked to be a **sinkhole** by 6\" for each previous battle round instead of 3\"."
      },
      "effect": {
       "ja": "",
       "en": "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll."
      }
     },
